{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Minimal Soundboard for Maximum Control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engineered for speed and simplicity, SoundCat gives you total control over your audio triggers. With hotkey support, and usage stats. It's everything you need without the bloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/customization-alt.png?t=1749318163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global Hotkeys</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger sounds anytime, anywhere, even while gaming or tabbed out.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully Customizable</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from built-in themes, fonts, and icon styles to match your setup.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Usage Stats</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track your most-played sounds and monitor your soundboard usage over time.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock achievements just by using SoundCat.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/hotkeys-alt.png?t=1749318163\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782290?t=1749318163","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/db3a2169c55e664f01fef034ede9ad4fe9cfac40/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749318163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/18f0948e74382927b0e1d8d9702b91986d788b87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749318163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st